   "subject": "Re: Plotly Heatmap & Scatter Linked in Shiny Not Working in a Module",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">By the way, someone helped me through this and found a work around for the fact that Plotly makes it difficult to work in the module context (I think modules are fantastic it isnt a shiny limitation in this case but really a plotly one).<div>See the answer here, hope it helps others.</div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37151795/plotly-heatmap-scatter-linked-in-shiny-not-working-in-a-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37151795/plotly-heatmap-scatter-linked-in-shiny-not-working-in-a-module&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393541627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3F_YpWJSUj4IsIRqUwKiVP\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37151795/plotly-heatmap-scatter-linked-in-shiny-not-working-in-a-module</a></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Wednesday, May 11, 2016 at 7:25:43 AM UTC-4, Trevor Nederlof wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:16.9px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-right:15px;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"text-align:center;min-width:46px\"><span style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:20px;display:block;color:rgb(106,115,124)\"></span></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:5px;width:660px;word-wrap:break-word\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\">Following the example at: <a href=\"https://plot.ly/r/shinyapp-linked-click/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,89,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plot.ly/r/shinyapp-linked-click/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393541627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13-fmCGQrreMoeVzozvvUX\">https://plot.ly/r/shinyapp-linked-click/</a> I was able to in a blank shiny project get this working (correlation matrix linked to a scatter graph). However, when I do the same in a shiny module the event_data based click action doesnt seem to work (the scatter remains blank no mater what happens, seems like the click is not connecting).</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\">My SO question is here, in case you have an answer can post there and I will accept it too.</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37151795/plotly-heatmap-scatter-linked-in-shiny-not-working-in-a-module\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37151795/plotly-heatmap-scatter-linked-in-shiny-not-working-in-a-module&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393541627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3F_YpWJSUj4IsIRqUwKiVP\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/37151795/plotly-heatmap-scatter-linked-in-shiny-not-working-in-a-module</a></span><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\">My reproducible example is below, any ideas or solutions would be much appreciated.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;clear:both\"><br></p><div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;width:660px;word-wrap:break-word\"><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;font-size:13px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">plotly</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(133,140,147)\">#### Define Modules ####</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\ncorrelation_matrix_shinyUI </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">id</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  ns </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> NS</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">id</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\n  mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n    plotlyOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">ns</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;corr_matrix&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> height </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;650px&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n    plotlyOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">ns</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;scatterplot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> height </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;550px&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\ncorrelation_matrix_shiny </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">input</span><span style=